    "Token 由主程序通过 Keychain 保存。传输加密启用时，连接还需要对应的公钥。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The token is stored by the app in the Keychain. When transport encryption is enabled, connecting also requires the matching public key."
